{
  "about": "Shared vectors for the dependency audit (swamp-club#3352 push, swamp-club#3353 scorecard, swamp-club#3354 and swamp-club#3682 scoring). Copy verbatim; the swamp copy is the source. `resolution`: the version that ships for a specifier; `locked` lists every version a lockfile records for the package, `lockedFor` the version it records for this specifier itself. `findings`: the exact findings push reports for one specifier, given the registry's answer; `scorecardMessage`, where present, is the scorecard's wording of the same finding. Each expected finding's `pointsLost` is what it alone costs the rubric's 2-point dependency-trust factor: 2 for every error, `not-audited`, `deprecated-version` and `jsr-yanked`, 1 for `loose-specifier`, 0 otherwise. Push only warns on the warning causes. `scoring`: the factor's earned points (0, 1 or 2) for a combination of findings: any finding costing 2 gives 0; otherwise any loose finding gives 1, however many; otherwise 2. `loose-specifier` findings count per distinct dependency.",
  "resolution": [
    {
      "name": "exact pin",
      "registry": "npm",
      "spec": "1.2.0",
      "published": {
        "versions": [
          "1.0.0",
          "1.2.0",
          "1.2.5"
        ],
        "distTags": {
          "latest": "1.2.5"
        }
      },
      "expect": {
        "version": "1.2.0",
        "from": "exact",
        "kind": "exact"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "= exact pin",
      "registry": "npm",
      "spec": "=1.2.0",
      "published": {
        "versions": [
          "1.2.0"
        ],
        "distTags": {}
      },
      "expect": {
        "version": "1.2.0",
        "from": "exact",
        "kind": "exact"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "v exact pin",
      "registry": "npm",
      "spec": "v1.2.0",
      "published": {
        "versions": [
          "1.2.0"
        ],
        "distTags": {}
      },
      "expect": {
        "version": "1.2.0",
        "from": "exact",
        "kind": "exact"
      }
    },
    {
